# Missions: a trick step on air (Skye: 0.9 s of air taken off on the east slope of Alamo Square), the
# slope ridden as tour-hayes rides its Postcard Air: down from the top, two full ollies.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start postcard 1
cmd 0 teleport -1073 460 64.6 90
hold up 10..300
hold ollie 300..330
hold ollie 610..640
run 900
expect event missionStep{mission=postcard,step=1,kind=trick} within 1..1
expect event talk{line=postcard-04,bark=true} within 1..1
expect event missionStep{mission=postcard,step=2,kind=talk} within 440..452
